1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:03,037
(Bernadette:)Throw the damn ball!

2
00:00:09,709 --> 00:00:12,179
(Amy:)So when do you guys
plan on getting married?

3
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:14,248
(Penny:)Uh, we're not sure.
But I want to wait long enough

4
00:00:14,247 --> 00:00:16,317
(Penny:)to prove to my mother
I'm not pregnant.

5
00:00:18,385 --> 00:00:20,185
(Sheldon:)May I have
one of your fries?

6
00:00:20,186 --> 00:00:21,816
(Amy:)Of course.

7
00:00:21,821 --> 00:00:23,651
(Amy:)Can I have a bite
of your burger?

8
00:00:23,657 --> 00:00:25,687
(Sheldon:)Absolutely not.

9
00:00:25,692 --> 00:00:28,062
(Leonard:)Some perfect couple.

10
00:00:28,061 --> 00:00:29,661
(Leonard:)He won't even share
his food with her.

11
00:00:29,663 --> 00:00:31,493
(Sheldon:)It has avocado on it.

12
00:00:31,498 --> 00:00:33,698
(Sheldon:)She's allergic
to avocado.

13
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,170
(Sheldon:)Are you so jealous
of our relationship

14
00:00:36,169 --> 00:00:38,739
(Sheldon:)you want Amy to die?

15
00:00:38,738 --> 00:00:41,208
(Leonard:)I'm not jealous.

16
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:43,377
(Leonard:)I just think it's silly for
you to compare relationships

17
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,906
(Leonard:)like they're something
that can be quantified.

